WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.650
Luke dashes after the prerequisite target-combo knockdown.

2
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:01.250
Standing heavy kick hits Ken as he rises.

3
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:01.900
Crouching heavy punch follows the heavy kick.

4
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.150
One Perfect medium Flash Knuckle launches Ken with its two-hit action.

5
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:04.100
Perfect light Flash Knuckle launches Ken again.

6
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.700
Heavy Flash Knuckle completes the wake-up conversion.
